 "submission": {
  "summary": "F-12’s water cut likely did not closely follow choke in 2011-2013: calculation suggests a month-average correlation of about 0.40 (daily about 0.41), with water cut climbing steadily from 72% to 95% while choke was already wide open and often at 100%. This suggests water cut was driven by reservoir waterflood breakthrough, not by choke position.",
