    "claim": "Water cut rose continuously from 72% in Jan 2011 to 95% in Dec 2013 while choke stayed high, averaging 77% in 2011 and at 100% in 2012.",
    "detail": "production_monthly E2: 2011-01 water_cut 0.7232 choke 50.38%; 2013-12 water_cut 0.9467 choke 94.53%; threshold 0.80 first crossed 2012-02-14 (E4). waterflood by_year: 2011 liquid 4970 Sm3/d choke 77.11% water_cut 0.7586; 2012 liquid 5260 choke 100.0% water_cut 0.8604; 2013 liquid 5096 choke 99.61% water_cut 0.9044 (E3). Low choke months in 2012-08/09 coincide with 13 and 2 producing days shut-ins (E2,E4), not reservoir response.",
